              <h4 class="font-bold text-[#0f274a] text-sm sm:text-base mb-2">Can you make a Kia key if all keys are lost?</h4>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Yes! We can decode the lock tumblers and program a brand new smart fob from scratch on-site.</p>
            </div>
          
        </div>
